.TH PARCEL\-EVENTS\-CLI\-PICKUPS 1 "Doctorine" "1.5.0"
.SH NAME
parcel\-events\-cli\-pickups \- pickups commands for parcel\-events\-cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B parcel\-events\-cli pickups
<verb> [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Group page for \fBpickups\fR. One page per group, not per leaf.
Stable bind id is \fBx\-operation\-key\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP "pickups cancel"
DELETE /v1/pickups/{pickup_id}
.IP "pickups create"
POST /v1/pickups
.IP "pickups list"
GET /v1/pickups
.IP "pickups retrieve"
GET /v1/pickups/{pickup_id}
.SH SEE ALSO
parcel\-events\-cli(1), COMMANDS.md, SKILL.md
